{
  "_what": "Step 31 settings sheet for the SCF (design/cell_method.md, section 2). Read by 31_train.py and copied into every run's train_meta.json. Dollar amounts are 2015 dollars on the PUF's scale; for the other waves the same slices are used, which sit on each wave's grown ruler, so the ranges stretch with the IRS growth in each item.",
